      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Entire holding on approx. 0.76 acres to include the main semi-detached residence plus separate detached outbuildings\r\nSemi-detached Art Deco residence on an elevated site with breathtaking views of the sea and city skyline\r\nDetached outbuildings have potential for multiple uses (s.p.p.)\r\nLarge deck for outdoor dining and soaking up the view\r\nWell proportioned light filled accommodation with many rooms enjoying sea views\r\n﻿﻿Close to Howth Golf Club with Howth Yacht Club nearby.\r\n﻿﻿Excellent Boys and Girls schools in Howth and Sutton.\r\n﻿﻿Good transport links with Howth DART and frequent Dublin Bus service (Route 31 & 31 a) to the summit.\r\nMinutes walk from Howth Summit with its panoramic view of Dublin Bay.\r\nLocal amenities include a sailing club, tennis club, golf courses and a variety of shops, restaurants and bars located in Howth Village and West Pier. \r\nBeautiful walking routes, cliff walks and beaches close by.Detached outbuildings have potential for multiple uses (s.p.p.)"
